{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of the existence assertion in Theorem 1.1 of arXiv:2608.12280v1 with the sharp constant K = 1: for every countable Bessel sequence with bound 1 in a complex Hilbert space, there exist measurable functions on the unit interval, pointwise bounded by 1, whose correlations reproduce the sequence's Gram matrix. This solves an open problem posed by Olevskii.",
